typechecker state committer has incorrect behavior for nested loops
### Version Information

### What's your issue about?

per @trocher - as of https://github.com/vyperlang/vyper/commit/66930fdfc396a883049c512290260818aa69ab9a, this does not compile:
```vyper
@external
def foo():
    for i in [1]:
        a:uint256 = i
        b:uint16 = i
